{"id":"H3356","lemma":"יָקִים","transliteration":"yaqim","sayIt":"ya-qim","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jakim","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.19;\nson of: Shimei (H8096N);\nbrother of: Zichri (H2147H), Zabdi (H2067H), Elienai (H0462), Zillethai (H6769), Eliel (H0447H), Adaiah (H5718H), Beraiah (H1256) and Shimrath (H8119)\n§ Jakim = \"He will raise\"\n1) a Benjamite and descendant of Shimhi\n2) a Levite priest in charge of the 12th course in the time of David","glosses":["jakim"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jakim","kjv":"And Jakim"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Jakim","kjv":"to Jakim"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:19","note":"Jakim, Zichri, Zabdi,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0447","lemma":"אֱלִיאֵל","transliteration":"eliel","gloss":"Eliel"},{"id":"H0462","lemma":"אֱלִיעֵינַי","transliteration":"elienay","gloss":"Elienai"},{"id":"H1256","lemma":"בְּרָאיָה","transliteration":"berayah","gloss":"Beraiah"},{"id":"H2067","lemma":"זַבְדִּי","transliteration":"zavdi","gloss":"Zabdi"},{"id":"H2147","lemma":"זִכְרִי","transliteration":"zikhri","gloss":"Zichri"},{"id":"H8096","lemma":"שִׁמְעִי","transliteration":"shimi","gloss":"Shimei"},{"id":"H6769","lemma":"צִלְּתַי","transliteration":"tsilltay","gloss":"Zillethai"},{"id":"H5718","lemma":"עֲדָיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"adayah","gloss":"Adaiah"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3356H","gloss":"Jakim","relation":"H3356H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}